Subject: net: airoha: port guarded VLAN-aware bridge cache-miss binding

Based on naoki66 brightspeed 9990/9993/9994 at c15760c70b7ceeb85fd852d081b06c4bcac1cf5c.
Retains local 930 native L2B and 931-937 reliability fixes.
Local additions: explicit DHCP/control-plane and egress guards.
Hardware-block gate and teardown are in the following patch.

